    "original": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "A cinematic side-profile portrait of a rugged man with a tied-back bun and full beard, wearing round dark sunglasses and a textured leather jacket. His skin is detailed and slightly weathered. The background is a futuristic sci-fi interface filled with glowing orange and red data streams, star maps, celestial navigation diagrams, grids, and holographic UI elements. Fiery particle effects and ember-like energy swirl around him, creating a cosmic, high-tech atmosphere. Dark color palette with strong contrast, dramatic lighting, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, 8K, cyberpunk aesthetic, cinematic composition, depth of field.",
      "source": "upstream"
    },
    "translations": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "language": "zh-CN",
        "value": "电影感的侧脸肖像，一个粗犷的男人，扎着马尾辫，留着浓密的胡须，戴着圆形深色太阳镜和质感皮革夹克。他的皮肤细节丰富，略带沧桑。背景是未来科幻界面，充满发光的橙红色数据流、星图、天体导航图、网格和全息UI元素。炽热的粒子效果和余烬般的能量在他周围旋转，营造出宇宙般的高科技氛围。深色调色板，对比强烈，戏剧性照明，超精细细节，锐利焦点，8K，赛博朋克美学，电影构图，景深。",
        "source": "ai",
